isco State College to Mills to get their masters degrees. They would be some of the first males to attend Mills. They allowed it on masters degree programs. It was through Howard that I heard about Darius Milhaud. While I was still a student at Pacific, I hitch-hiked down to Mills to meet with Darius Milhaud. He ...", "type": "string"}, "datatype": "string"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q7215$85300A4C-E9D3-494D-AC0E-7BEA510B0C10", "rank": "normal"}], "P20": [{"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P20", "hash": "3350511287732f02bd662655c312e5910e11ffa0", "datavalue": {"value": "https://semlab.s3.amazonaws.com/texts/28c7e27b63a73c4426771be57b736187/304.txt", "type": "string"}, "datatype": "url"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q7215$E6C8FC90-8413-4691-9FBF-2E67043047B6", "rank": "normal"}], "P21": [{"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P21", "hash": "ab25c28e1151b3099f412ca7edad35116ab8276a", "datavalue": {"value": {"entity-type": "item", "numeric-id": 574, "id": "Q574"}, "type": "wikibase-entityid"}, "datatype": "wikibase-item"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q7215$62AEC89F-480A-49F2-87F1-5AFBD2016BF3", "rank": "normal"}, {"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P21", "hash": "81ec4eeb6b200526256ad4b3e9ac7c0d7eaabe8b", "datavalue": {"value": {"entity-type": "item", "numeric-id": 598, "id": "Q598"}, "type": "wikibase-entityid"}, "datatype": "wikibase-item"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q7215$CD7DD2A4-287E-4154-9623-1554D4816567", "rank": "normal"}], "P22": [{"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P22", "hash": "ffc035cdb5d590554228b3ded2800686af011a07", "datavalue": {"value": {"entity-type": "item", "numeric-id": 311, "id": "Q311"}, "type": "wikibase-entityid"}, "datatype": "wikibase-item"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q7215$DF90839D-6C98-476A-8DCB-B4E2A8D9DEE5", "rank": "normal"}], "P23": [{"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P23", "hash": "f7aadf2d161c27532c50669fa7480a9405b847b6", "datavalue": {"value": {"entity-type": "item"